# 20 October 2026 : the organic cut of M1 (rules then tailor) run outside Houdini on the input Houdini gives it (DumpTailorContext.py), every core used, then
# measured like the score measures it (symmetry, staircases, notches, turns at regular vertices, largest island) and drawn (six views, islands in colour, seams in
# black, staircases and turns in red). Nothing here reads a reference uv : the reference is only drawn under it when given, for Matthieu's eye.
# Usage : python -I OfflineM1.py <context json> <out prefix> [--rules-only] [--prm key=value ...] [--ref <reference mesh.json>]
